docs {
  # List Templates
  
  Lists all templates with optional filters and pagination.
  
  **Visibility Rules:**
  - Admins see all templates
  - Lecturers see:
    - Their own templates (any status/visibility)
    - Approved public templates from others
  
  **Required Role:** ADMIN or LECTURER
  
  **Query Parameters:**
  - `page`: Page number (default: 1)
  - `page_size`: Items per page (default: 10)
  - `status`: Filter by approval status (pending, approved, rejected, deprecated)
  - `visibility`: Filter by visibility (private, public)
  - `owner_id`: Filter by owner ID
  - `search`: Search in name and description
  
  **Returns:** Paginated list of templates with metadata
}
